---
/** "This works best when" list. Same on home and /call. Quiet, centred. */
---

<div class="who center">
  <h2 data-lines>This works best when</h2>
  <ul class="plain-list who__list narrow">
    <li class="lead--big" data-reveal>You have real clients and a real team, and nobody whose full job is marketing.</li>
    <li class="lead--big" data-reveal>You're at the point of thinking about hiring a marketing person.</li>
    <li class="lead--big" data-reveal>You'll give us a few hours a month on camera.</li>
    <li class="lead--big" data-reveal>You want the company to look like what it is.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .who__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    margin-top: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px);
  }
  .who__list li {
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
</style>
